# Wholly authored light fixture (no game assets): white point lights over the floor.
newmodel vdr_sanctuary
setsupermodel vdr_sanctuary NULL
classification Effects
setanimationscale 1
beginmodelgeom vdr_sanctuary
node dummy vdr_sanctuary
 parent NULL
endnode
node light testlight0
 parent vdr_sanctuary
 position 0 0 1.0
 radius 4
 multiplier 2
 color 1 1 1
 isdynamic 1
 affectdynamic 1
 ambientonly 0
 lightpriority 5
 shadow 0
endnode
endmodelgeom vdr_sanctuary
donemodel vdr_sanctuary
